  - m_Id: 1392087524
    m_Localized: the {symbol} call made me {pct}%. appreciate it, really.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087525
    m_Localized: I myself earned {pct}% on the {symbol} call.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087526
    m_Localized: I personally made {pct}% on the {symbol} call. Thank you for that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087527
    m_Localized: I would prefer to watch {symbol} a bit longer.
    m_Metadata:
