  - m_Id: 1392087529
    m_Localized: I will follow the market from elsewhere. Goodbye, and take care.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087530
    m_Localized: i've had enough for today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087531
    m_Localized: ok that's enough for me. see you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087532
    m_Localized: I will end the conversation at this point.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087533
    m_Localized: I will stop the conversation here. Goodbye to you all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087534
    m_Localized: I have already been removed once before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087535
    m_Localized: I place verifiable information above confidence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087536
    m_Localized: I value what can be verified over confidence. My view differs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087537
    m_Localized: I had the same question.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087538
