      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087565
    m_Localized: "Accepted \xB7 Awaiting fill"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087566
    m_Localized: Honestly, {symbol} at {pct}% {profitKind} P&L is not easy to look
      at.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087567
    m_Localized: Truly, {symbol} at {pct}% {profitKind} P&L. Seeing a gain is a pleasure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087568
    m_Localized: "Honestly, {symbol} is at \xD0{price} and I have yet to reach a
      judgment."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087569
    m_Localized: "I ask in earnest. {symbol} is at \xD0{price}. What is your view?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087570
    m_Localized: "I am serious. \xD0{price} on {symbol} is my reference for the next
      move."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087571
    m_Localized: "I mean it. {symbol} is at \xD0{price}, and I am watching what happens
      next."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087572
    m_Localized: "I say this sincerely: {symbol} {profitKind} P&L of \xD0{amount}
      has made my day."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087573
    m_Localized: "I say this sincerely. {symbol} {profitKind} P&L is \xD0{amount}.
      I hope others are well."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087574
    m_Localized: I am being frank. {symbol} {profitKind} P&L is {pct}%. A difficult
      outcome.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087575
    m_Localized: 'In all honesty, {symbol} {profitKind} P&L: {pct}%. I cannot stop
      checking.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087576
    m_Localized: "I am serious. {symbol} realized P&L: \xD0{amount}. It was not a
      good experience."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087577
    m_Localized: I say this sincerely. The {symbol} call earned me {pct}%, and it
      helped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087578
    m_Localized: "I truly mean it. My realized P&L from the {symbol} call is \xD0{amount}.
      A good result."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087579
    m_Localized: "I am quite serious. {symbol} {profitKind} P&L: \xD0{amount}. May
      I boast this once?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087580
    m_Localized: "I am serious. {symbol} {profitKind} P&L has fallen to \xD0{amount}."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087581
    m_Localized: "In all sincerity, I confirmed realized P&L of \xD0{amount} after
      following the {symbol} order."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087582
    m_Localized: I say this in earnest. Following {symbol} gave me {pct}%. Please
      consider the losses too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087583
    m_Localized: "I mean it. The \xD0{amount} realized P&L on {symbol} stays on my
      record."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087584
    m_Localized: I mean it. I am checking {symbol} now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087585
    m_Localized: I mean it sincerely. Tell me what would change your view of {symbol}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087586
    m_Localized: Truly, my attention keeps returning to {symbol}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087587
    m_Localized: I am serious. Rumors about {symbol} and actual fills are separate
      matters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087588
    m_Localized: Seriously, now. Is there {symbol} news I've somehow missed?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087589
    m_Localized: 'I ask in earnest: what are you watching most closely on {symbol}?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087590
    m_Localized: To be clear, I want follow-through on {symbol}, not one good candle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087591
    m_Localized: 'Let me be plain: I won''t judge {symbol} on the order book alone.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087592
    m_Localized: In all seriousness, is anyone checking {symbol}'s book against actual
      prints?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087593
    m_Localized: I do mean this. Do you have anything on {symbol} besides the price?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087594
    m_Localized: With respect, "could happen" and "has been confirmed" are not the
      same.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087595
    m_Localized: 'I''ll say it plainly: two people can read the same tape differently.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087596
    m_Localized: Frankly, your explanation tends to show up before the result does.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087597
    m_Localized: Truly, I respect that you aren't rushing to a conclusion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087598
    m_Localized: Honestly, you keep picking at every word I say.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087599
    m_Localized: Sincerely, I'll keep that possibility on the table.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087600
    m_Localized: 'I must be direct: I can''t agree with that. Let''s start with the
      evidence.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087601
    m_Localized: I'll be blunt. That remark is simply ridiculous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087602
    m_Localized: 'I mean this: I take it back. I let my emotions answer.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087603
    m_Localized: For the record, I agree on that point. I'll keep watching.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087604
    m_Localized: To be frank, that explanation doesn't rule out the opposite move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087605
    m_Localized: 'I ask this seriously: did you check where that news came from?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087606
    m_Localized: In earnest, I'd like to know what actually backs that view up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087607
    m_Localized: Really now. If you just dig in like that, there's no conversation
      to have.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087608
    m_Localized: Honestly, I envy anyone who can be that certain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087609
    m_Localized: I mean it. I do understand how you got there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087610
    m_Localized: 'Please hear me: you don''t have to win it all back in a hurry.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087611
    m_Localized: Truthfully, staying won't change anything. I'll take my leave.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087612
    m_Localized: 'I say this in earnest: what we''ve verified matters more than who
      won.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087613
    m_Localized: Seriously, I'd like to ask whether anyone can check that for themselves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087614
    m_Localized: To be clear, holding a different opinion doesn't make it a bad call.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087615
    m_Localized: In all honesty, I'll watch {symbol}'s prints before anything else.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087616
    m_Localized: I mean this. Reading it back, my own words were part of the problem.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087617
    m_Localized: Frankly, I can't put up with that attitude much longer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087618
    m_Localized: With respect, you both seem heated. Let's take a short break.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087619
    m_Localized: 'I ask you both sincerely: pause, and check the evidence first.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087620
    m_Localized: Honestly, it sounds as if you'd picked your conclusion in advance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087621
    m_Localized: Truly, I know it weighs on you. It's fine to step back a while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087622
    m_Localized: I mean it, I'm listening. Take your time sorting it out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087623
    m_Localized: In fairness, hearing you out, there was something I'd left out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087624
    m_Localized: You certainly don't lack for confidence, I'll say that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087625
    m_Localized: I'm quite serious. My neck was stiff, so I fixed my posture.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087626
    m_Localized: No joke, a glass of water has helped somewhat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087627
    m_Localized: Truly, it's so quiet out that all I hear is my keyboard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087628
    m_Localized: 'A serious question: how do you rate the odds it goes the other
      way?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087629
    m_Localized: 'I say this sincerely: the host''s {symbol} call made me a real
      {pct}%.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087630
    m_Localized: Host, in all seriousness, please speak to the {pct}% on the {symbol}
      call too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087631
    m_Localized: 'Host, I ask in earnest: would you look over this exchange?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087632
    m_Localized: Host, I mean this. Please step in before it gets any bigger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087633
    m_Localized: 'Host, I''m asking plainly: please stop the attacks on each other.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087634
    m_Localized: Host, to be frank, the language here is going too far.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087635
    m_Localized: Honestly, I wonder whether the host is even reading this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087636
    m_Localized: Quite seriously, this looks like it needs the host to step in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087637
    m_Localized: I mean this. I raised my voice for no reason. I'll stop here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087638
    m_Localized: 'I''ll say it firmly: please stop talking down to people.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087639
    m_Localized: Sincerely, what I said to you was out of line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087640
    m_Localized: I ask in earnest that we keep the personal remarks down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087641
    m_Localized: Truly a fine explanation. A pity some of it still needs checking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087642
    m_Localized: No exaggeration, I looked at the clock and nearly skipped a meal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087643
    m_Localized: Honestly, you talk as if the market sends you the answers early.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087644
    m_Localized: 'A sincere question: as of when is the information you''re citing?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087645
    m_Localized: I mean it. I'm done here, and I won't remain in this room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087646
    m_Localized: In truth, we merely disagreed, and I answered far too sharply.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087647
    m_Localized: 'I ask sincerely: please go through the disagreements one at a time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087648
    m_Localized: 'Please, I mean this: remember that everyone else can read this
      too.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087649
    m_Localized: To be frank, I have no wish to continue this. I'm leaving the room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087650
    m_Localized: Honestly, I can't talk in an atmosphere like this. I'll be going.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087651
    m_Localized: Truly, it's fine to take your eyes off the screen for a bit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087652
    m_Localized: "In all seriousness, I'm watching the prints near \xD0{price} on
      {symbol}."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087653
    m_Localized: 'I say this honestly: I ended at {pct}% on the {symbol} call. Others
      may have fared better.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087654
    m_Localized: 'I mean this: I came out at {pct}% on the {symbol} call myself.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087655
    m_Localized: Truthfully, I'll watch the market from somewhere else. Goodbye.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087656
    m_Localized: I'm serious. This is where the conversation ends for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087657
    m_Localized: To be plain, I'll take checkable data over the size of anyone's
      conviction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087658
    m_Localized: "I won't dress it up. My {symbol} {profitKind} P&L is \xD0{amount}.
      I need a moment."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087659
    m_Localized: "I mean it sincerely: my {symbol} {profitKind} P&L is \xD0{amount}.
      I can smile today."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087660
    m_Localized: "For the record, my realized P&L on the {symbol} call is \xD0{amount}.
      I'm noting the loss."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087661
    m_Localized: Honestly, my {symbol} {profitKind} P&L stands at {pct}%. Long may
      it last.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087662
    m_Localized: In truth, my {symbol} {profitKind} P&L is {pct}%. I'm rethinking
      my judgment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087663
    m_Localized: "I state this sincerely: my records show \xD0{amount} realized on
      the {symbol} call."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087664
    m_Localized: Seriously, my yardstick is the next {symbol} prints. No verdict
      yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087665
    m_Localized: 'I''m being honest: my view isn''t final either. Still studying
      {symbol}.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087666
    m_Localized: I mean this. I went too far with my words, and I apologize.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087667
    m_Localized: Sincerely, I hope you won't be too hard on yourself right now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087668
    m_Localized: Frankly, you need to collect your wits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087669
    m_Localized: In all honesty, I think I brewed this coffee too strong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087670
    m_Localized: Please believe me, you don't have to carry this alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087671
    m_Localized: Quite honestly, my eyes are worn out from staring at the screen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087672
    m_Localized: Frankly, there's still more to confirm before anyone is certain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087673
    m_Localized: 'I mean it, I agree as well: confirm first, decide after.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
