  - m_Id: 1392087687
    m_Localized: A policy change can affect firms in the same industry differently,
      depending on preparation. Higher costs and shifts in competition both play
      a role.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087688
    m_Localized: Rather than judging a policy by its name, examine who actually receives
      the benefits and bears the burden.
