  - m_Id: 1392088262
    m_Localized: Company changes can be read through earnings, customer ties and
      business continuity. Investors' experiences give different weight to the same
      news.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392088263
    m_Localized: one at a time. can't even tell what anyone's saying rn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392088264
    m_Localized: One controversy does not end every relationship. Repeated problems,
      however, can exhaust even supporters' patience.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392088265
    m_Localized: One move isn't enough to draw a conclusion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392088266
    m_Localized: One company's contract is not good news for every related business.
      Competitors sharing its customers and suppliers receiving orders may react
      differently.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392088267
