  - m_Id: 1392088277
    m_Localized: Payment terms and business continuity may matter more to suppliers
      and staff than the share price. One story can reveal several different priorities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392088278
    m_Localized: Watch whether standards change across suppliers as well.
