  - m_Id: 1392088332
    m_Localized: Environment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392088333
    m_Localized: Environmental decisions can alter both capital costs and brand trust.
      Short-term spending and long-term viability should be weighed separately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392088334
    m_Localized: New environmental standards may offer opportunities to prepared
      companies and costs to those lagging behind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392088335
    m_Localized: Environment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392088336
    m_Localized: patients and researchers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392088337
    m_Localized: No active call
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
