    m_Localized: "Company name \xB7 2\u201320 characters"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392088345
    m_Localized: Check the company name.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392088346
    m_Localized: Longtime followers may treat a new deal as proof of technical strength.
      Cautious investors may wait for margins and cancellation terms.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392088347
    m_Localized: Even supporters can turn away when core values are violated. A responsible
      response can instead deepen support.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392088348
    m_Localized: Supportive investors may see a new rule as an opportunity, while
      customers and rivals worry about other aspects.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392088349
    m_Localized: Saw a member's real profit report
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
