  - m_Id: 395375667679247
    m_Localized: Shows on the chart what retail investors currently believe this
      stock is worth. It swells and deflates with rumors, news and manipulation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 395375667679248
    m_Localized: Real company value
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 395375667679249
    m_Localized: Shows on the chart the real per-share value based on earnings and
      outlook. Its gap from the crowd price is the size of the bubble.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603803324416
    m_Localized: took profits on part of {stockName}. letting the rest ride
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878848
    m_Localized: sold about half my {stockName}. can finally watch this in peace
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878849
    m_Localized: sold a little {stockName} and locked some in. rest is house money
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878850
    m_Localized: partial profits on {stockName}. couldn't bring myself to sell it
      all
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878851
    m_Localized: I've taken partial profits on {stockName}. I'll watch the remainder
      a bit longer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878852
    m_Localized: I've closed part of my {stockName} at a gain. The rest stays, as
      planned.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878853
    m_Localized: unloaded part of {stockName}. rest rides till the end
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878854
    m_Localized: sold some {stockName}, banked it. hanging on to what's left
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878855
    m_Localized: cut part of my {stockName}. couldn't make myself dump all of it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878856
    m_Localized: trimmed my {stockName}. sold at a loss so yeah, it stings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878857
    m_Localized: I've sold part of {stockName} at a loss. Reducing exposure seemed
      the right call.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878858
    m_Localized: cut some {stockName} at a loss. got lighter before the bags got
      heavier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878859
    m_Localized: Congratulations. That's a fine result.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878860
    m_Localized: Congratulations on the gain. Best of luck to the finish!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878861
    m_Localized: I'm envious. I hope you manage to keep it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878862
    m_Localized: A sound call. Best of luck to you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878863
    m_Localized: Seeing you do well lifts my mood too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878864
    m_Localized: Congratulations. I hope you get safely to your exit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878865
    m_Localized: Remarkable. I'd like to learn how you do it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878866
    m_Localized: Well traded. May the good results continue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878867
    m_Localized: oh congrats, lucky you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878868
    m_Localized: jealous lol, good luck!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878869
    m_Localized: nice one. keeping the gains is half the battle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878870
    m_Localized: congrats! hoping i get a day like that
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878871
    m_Localized: whoa nice. hang onto it all the way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878872
    m_Localized: congrats. gonna soak up some of that good luck
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878873
    m_Localized: good luck! seriously jealous
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878874
    m_Localized: nicely done. go treat yourself to a good dinner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878875
    m_Localized: oh, congrats. must be nice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878876
    m_Localized: jealous. go get that money
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878877
    m_Localized: good for you. keeping it is the real skill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878878
    m_Localized: congrats. i'm next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878879
    m_Localized: lucky. bank it all the way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878880
    m_Localized: respect. today's your day
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878881
    m_Localized: happy trading, boss. jealous though
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878882
    m_Localized: good job. just don't get greedy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878883
    m_Localized: If you haven't sold yet, it isn't quite a profit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878884
    m_Localized: How nice for you. Whether tomorrow agrees is another question.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878885
    m_Localized: It's never too late to boast after you've sold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878886
    m_Localized: It's possible you were simply fortunate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878887
    m_Localized: You do become talkative whenever you're in profit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878888
    m_Localized: Sigh... I doubt that needed saying here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878889
    m_Localized: Congratulations, though it comes across a little strong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878890
    m_Localized: As I recall, you were rather quiet during the last loss.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878891
    m_Localized: ugh... you came here to brag?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878892
    m_Localized: it's only a number until you hit sell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878893
    m_Localized: must be nice~ not sure i'd call it skill though
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878894
    m_Localized: i'm getting jealous, cut it out haha
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878895
    m_Localized: if that number's still there tomorrow, we'll talk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878896
    m_Localized: you only show up when you're green huh
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878897
    m_Localized: yes yes, you're amazing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878898
    m_Localized: brag after you've actually sold
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878899
    m_Localized: ugh... bragging again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878900
    m_Localized: ain't your money till you sell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878901
    m_Localized: that's luck. you call that skill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878902
    m_Localized: i'm sick with envy. stop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878903
    m_Localized: you're giving it all back tomorrow, bet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878904
    m_Localized: only shows up when it's going up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878905
    m_Localized: yeah yeah, you're the best
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878906
    m_Localized: sell first, then yap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878907
    m_Localized: Forgive me, but is that true?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878908
    m_Localized: I'm curious when you bought.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878909
    m_Localized: ?? Have you checked that number again?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878910
    m_Localized: I wonder whether you read your average cost correctly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878911
    m_Localized: That timing is rather hard to credit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878912
    m_Localized: Have you actually sold, or are you still holding?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878913
    m_Localized: Remarkable if true, but I'd like to know the basis.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878914
    m_Localized: Was that large a gain even possible there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878915
    m_Localized: ?? for real?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878916
    m_Localized: when'd you buy to get that number?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878917
    m_Localized: kinda hard to believe without a screenshot lol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878918
    m_Localized: you sure you're reading your avg cost right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878919
    m_Localized: that timing's a bit too perfect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878920
    m_Localized: you sell or still holding?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878921
    m_Localized: ehh no way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878922
    m_Localized: ?? how's that work?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878923
    m_Localized: ?? you serious
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878924
    m_Localized: when the hell did you buy to get that
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878925
    m_Localized: no screenshot, not buying it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878926
    m_Localized: you sure you read your avg right
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878927
    m_Localized: timing's way too clean
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878928
    m_Localized: so sold, or holding
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878929
    m_Localized: anyone's rich in a chat box
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878930
    m_Localized: ??
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878931
    m_Localized: May I ask what price you bought in at?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
