      broken"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284493
    m_Localized: fr {symbol} is hands-off today i think
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284494
    m_Localized: "I agree. Seeing {symbol} pushed down to \xD0{price}, it does look
      weak."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284495
    m_Localized: "I'm of the same mind. If \xD0{dayLow} gives way, I think it slides
      further."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284496
    m_Localized: "Well said. The descent from the \xD0{dayHigh} high to here is no
      small thing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284497
    m_Localized: "yeah nothing to look at in {symbol} today. still stuck on \xD0{price}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284498
    m_Localized: "was thinking that too. tune it out until it's over \xD0{dayHigh}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284499
    m_Localized: "true. until the \xD0{dayLow}-\xD0{dayHigh} box breaks i'm just
      a spectator"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284500
    m_Localized: fr at times like this sitting still is the money maker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284501
    m_Localized: "I agree. {symbol} has been unchanged at \xD0{price} today."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284502
    m_Localized: "That's my view also. Until it passes \xD0{dayHigh}, I'll do no
      more than watch."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284503
    m_Localized: "Well said. I'll wait for it to break out of the \xD0{dayLow}-\xD0{dayHigh}
      band."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284504
    m_Localized: "it's up, sure, but buying the chase at \xD0{price} is another matter"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284505
    m_Localized: "idk. can't clear \xD0{dayHigh} and this might be the top"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284506
    m_Localized: "aren't you looking at only the good side? it's run a lot from the
      \xD0{dayLow} low already"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284507
    m_Localized: every time i get in on something like this i get stuck. i'll judge
      once it cools
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284508
    m_Localized: "It's risen, granted, but buying the chase at \xD0{price} is another
      matter, I think."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284509
    m_Localized: "My view differs a little. Failing \xD0{dayHigh}, this could well
      be the high."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284510
    m_Localized: "It has already climbed a great deal from the \xD0{dayLow} low.
      I don't think this is the place to hurry."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284511
    m_Localized: "it's down, sure, but isn't \xD0{price} kind of a nice spot to look?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284512
    m_Localized: "idk. if \xD0{dayLow} doesn't break we could get a bounce here"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284513
    m_Localized: "aren't you a little too scared? pullbacks like this off the \xD0{dayHigh}
      high are common"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284514
    m_Localized: they say buy when everyone's scared. i'll watch a bit more and scoop
      some
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284515
    m_Localized: "It's fallen, granted, but at \xD0{price} I'd say it merits a closer
      look."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284516
    m_Localized: "My view differs a little. Should \xD0{dayLow} hold, a rebound could
      follow."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284517
    m_Localized: "A correction of this size from the \xD0{dayHigh} high is ordinary.
      I see little cause for alarm."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284518
    m_Localized: "dunno the reason either. over \xD0{dayHigh} i buy, if not i don't"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284519
    m_Localized: "i'm not going in at \xD0{price}. if it pulls back near \xD0{dayLow}
      i'll look then"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284520
    m_Localized: "if i buy, just a little. if i'm wrong i cut when \xD0{dayLow} breaks"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284521
    m_Localized: didn't see any news. think it's just up because lots of people are
      buying
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284522
    m_Localized: "I don't know the reason either. I'm simply using \xD0{dayHigh}
      as my marker."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284523
    m_Localized: "I won't be entering at \xD0{price}. If it eases back toward \xD0{dayLow},
      I'll reconsider."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284524
    m_Localized: I found no related news. It only looks as though buyers are in control.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284525
    m_Localized: "dunno the reason either. under \xD0{dayLow} i keep watching, if
      it holds i might scoop a little"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284526
    m_Localized: "i'm not buying at \xD0{price} yet. can still get in after the bounce
      is confirmed"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284527
    m_Localized: didn't see any news. think it's just down because lots of people
      are selling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284528
    m_Localized: "if i were holding i'd use \xD0{dayLow} as the line. below that,
      no clue"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284529
    m_Localized: "I don't know the reason either. I'm simply watching whether \xD0{dayLow}
      survives."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284530
    m_Localized: "I'm not yet a buyer at \xD0{price}. Waiting for a confirmed rebound
      costs little."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284531
    m_Localized: I found no related news. It only looks as though sellers are in
      control.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284532
    m_Localized: no reason. think everyone's just off watching other tickers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284533
    m_Localized: "not touching it till it's over \xD0{dayHigh}. don't want cash tied
      up in chop"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284534
    m_Localized: "up or down, i'll go with whichever side of \xD0{dayLow}-\xD0{dayHigh}
      it exits"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284535
    m_Localized: "if you're gonna wait, nibbling a little near \xD0{price} is one
      way i guess"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284536
    m_Localized: I see no special reason. Interest seems to have gone to other stocks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284537
    m_Localized: "I don't intend to lay a finger on it before it passes \xD0{dayHigh}."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547695613284538
    m_Localized: "I mean to follow whichever way it exits the \xD0{dayLow}-\xD0{dayHigh}
      band."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 552063494361088
    m_Localized: "ok everyone, {symbol} is \xD0{price}. i'll be doing the play-by-play
      lmao"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
